    {
      "resource_id": "ppt_001",
      "resource_type": "ppt",
      "filename": "Means to overcome Barriers and Conflict (1).pptx",
      "subject_id": "subject_001",
      "content": [
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_1",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 1,
          "text": "Means to Overcome Barriers\n(Conflict Management)",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_2",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 2,
          "text": "Conflict Management\n   What do you understand by the term conflict?",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_3",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 3,
          "text": "Benefits of having a conflict:\nIf managed properly conflicts can lead to positive outcome.\nHelps to analyze goals in real-time\nCreates dialogue\nFosters creative solutions\nConflict helps to overcome individual psychological barriers by forcing people out of their traditional mode of thinking.\nHigher decision quality especially when the resistance is strong\n\n    Without conflict organizations and employees stagnate",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_4",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 4,
          "text": "Types of Conflict:\nInterpersonal\nOrganizational\nTechnical\nNational and International",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_5",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 5,
          "text": "Conflict resolution Strategies:\nAvoiding\nAccommodating\nCompromising\nForcing\nProblem solving- Negotiating",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_6",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 6,
          "text": "Negotiating as the best strategy:\n\n\nCooperation is better than Competition\nParties can be trusted (Communication Pyramid)\nDifferences can be minimized\nMutually acceptable solution can be found",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_7",
          "location_type": "slide",
          "location_number": 7,
          "text": "Communication Pyramid",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
        {
          "content_id": "ppt_001_slide_8",
